[E0301] Error: expected `own<(i64) => i64>`, found a lambda
    ╭─[ err/105_owned_closures/main.wip:25:47 ]
    │
 25 │ fn missingOwn(n: i64): own<(x: i64) => i64> = (x) => x + n
    │                                               ──────┬─────  
    │                                                     ╰─────── a lambda that is not owned
    │ 
    │ Help: write `own` before it
    │ 
    │ Note: an owned closure holds what it captured on the heap, so it is written with `own`, as every other allocation is
